# Project: MQL5 Expert Advisor for MetaTrader 5

- Language: MQL5 only. No Python, no MQL4 functions.
- Output is ONE file: TrendEA.mq5. Do not split into includes
  unless I ask.
- The specification is TZ_trend_EA_EN.md. Follow it exactly.
  Do not add indicators, conditions or features not in the spec.
  If something is ambiguous, ask before coding.
- All signal logic runs on CLOSED bars only (shift = 1).
  Never use the current forming bar for decisions.
- Every threshold and parameter is an `input`, grouped with
  `input group`. No magic numbers in the code.
- Never hardcode the symbol name. Use _Symbol and _Period.
- Use CTrade for orders. Check retcode after every trade call.
- Do not invent MQL5 functions. If unsure an API exists, say so
  instead of guessing.
- Forbidden: martingale, averaging, grids, trailing stop,
  breakeven, partial close.
- Comment the code. Keep functions small and named as in the spec.